    {
      "key": "p2",
      "name": "Astrolabe",
      "passage": "Astrolabe is a place to dream, connect and build. Danny and I make it so people can reach their goals with support, accountability and tools of their own. It keeps teaching me to empower myself and those around me, now that our dreams are more within reach than ever.",
